  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "長濱"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span><b>何明洲</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一、月光海</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">思念化做月光鬚</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">飄散tī無眠ê長濱藍</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Uì目睭流出　無聲ê</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海湧</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">二、吳若石（Jio̍k-si̍k）神父</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊是Swiss　是Amis　是長濱　是台灣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊ná石　ná山</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">踮tī艱苦人ê心內</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiânn做in永遠ê靠山</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">三、部落散步</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海風微微　部落ê下晡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一隻烏狗tī大樹跤　陷眠</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám仔店開滿　囡仔快樂ê心花</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大人坐tī門口埕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Si̍p酒　看海　ǹg望</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">豐收ê好年冬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">四、母仔囝</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">金剛山跤ê田岸　草仔輕輕仔搖</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">母親溫柔ê手　牽囡仔&nbsp;</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沓沓仔行</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溫暖ê金光　掖tī in ê肩胛頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像leh講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">望你平安　望你快樂</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><b>作者註：</b>寫tsit篇〈長濱〉是因為阮kap阮某lóng真愛台東ê長濱，幾若年來，ē-tàng講一年上少ē去一擺（駛車上無ài六點鐘)。看著hit个海kap hit个人（親像吳若石神父），一切lóng有價值--ah。所擺，阮想beh kā去長濱ê心情寫--落-來，將看--過ê景、看--過ê人，lóng記--落-來。未來走無法ê時，ē-tàng tī心中記念hit phiàn海。</div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE4O_Jy99joe5ECXoAR1DuMXEbntujRjjZ1L6ZRyBLk8vGQFGYWIN4xKfUODgSKTbexICUTztu4taCsBKSU3qyKd-WptX8HXXmA0jNyE6gzmFgV5meOiWaobtip_zs0m9jOA6O5T6uqKlPFTUd70YviL8i32bll-yyvGiPJGeCYpmOrVWxuFISbi_m1A/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjUvaj7t9eyPT8e6lfYQm2GUdkHn6vUWoSerNlc5-2KxLIMTX-jpYiOQVTWiQdxq-rrmQ_K1fwCh9DlLiXA50b55_z-euDnkupYUN_4ZU3zc9zlW8gx9rD18KF8qMZFDHINAz8tun3qUqJy3I9ezVqMakHWr